\f0\b\fs28 \cf0 Campaign Structure\
\pard\pardeftab720\sa240\partightenfactor0

\f1\b0\fs24 \cf0 Campaign structure is one of the most important keys to allowing for your ads to get maximized performance.\
The goal is to maximize best sellers.\
The structure depends on size of account and skus:\
\pard\tx220\tx720\pardeftab720\li720\fi-720\partightenfactor0
\ls2\ilvl0\cf0 \kerning1\expnd0\expndtw0 \outl0\strokewidth0 {\listtext	\uc0\u8226 	}\expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0
\outl0\strokewidth0 \strokec2 For lots of skus and brands, group by Tiers for your middle of the pack Brands and Product Categories.\
\ls2\ilvl0\kerning1\expnd0\expndtw0 \outl0\strokewidth0 {\listtext	\uc0\u8226 	}\expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0
\outl0\strokewidth0 \strokec2 For smaller spenders, keep this simple. Focus on Top Sellers and group your other products into a catch all campaign.\
\pard\pardeftab720\sa240\partightenfactor0

