\f0\b\fs28 \cf0 Bidding & Budgets\
\pard\pardeftab720\sa240\partightenfactor0

\f1\b0\fs24 \cf0 Budgets should be allocated in a manner where best sellers are not being limited.\
When you are query sculpting make sure you are using a shared budget between your campaign splits.\
For bids, you ideally want to be running tROAS once your campaign(s) is dialed in. However, in the beginning of a new account or new campaign you\'92ll usually need to work on Manual CPC or you can test tROAS at a very small ROAS target (e.g. <100%)\
\pard\pardeftab720\sa240\partightenfactor0
